TORONTO, ON--(Marketwired - Jul 24, 2017) - RightSourcing announced today that its WAND Mobile Supplier (MSI) App has been released to market. The new mobile browser-based software has been designed to work seamlessly within their existing product lines. The MSI App allows suppliers and vendors the ability to make decisions in real time while working on site and provides information instantly when you need to access data while in the field.
